# HANGTEST=nandrnc (docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, hang 18, split b):
# nandram (nandwdt + ramoops/pstore and nanddbg's two no-map 1 MB areas)
# with ramoops' console-size and pmsg-size 0 (nandboot-nandrnc.dts): it
# maps its area but writes it only on a panic or oops.
# DEBUG IMAGE ONLY: it arms a hardware watchdog, so each run needs the
# owner's OK.
CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=ttyS0,115200n8 marvell_nand.write_window=1741,4091 panic=10 consoleblank=0 timer_mv61x0.hang_wdt=30"
CONFIG_PSTORE=y
CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM=y
CONFIG_PSTORE_CONSOLE=y
CONFIG_PSTORE_PMSG=y
